{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/c8c8dd036145c9abc712821901397c36.avif?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>demo version of Blast Head</strong>, giving you a taste of pure chaos. Thrown into a hostile arena as a failed experiment, your only mission is simple: survive and spread destruction.<br><br><strong>Blast Head</strong> is a <strong>bullet heaven</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> where every run feels fresh. In the demo, you\u2019ll get a glimpse of absurd weapons, unpredictable synergies, and the nonstop action that defines the full game.<br><br>Quick sessions, escalating waves, and over-the-top mayhem make this demo just the beginning. Step in, experiment with chaos, and prepare for the full experience coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=37 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.poster.avif?t=1760349741\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.webm?t=1760349741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.mp4?t=1760349741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/ae32a7052f0d86ee78073dcd4cccfaad.avif?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=212 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you\u2019ll get access to 3 weapons, each with its own skill tree.<br> <br>Experiment with different upgrades, create powerful synergies between them, and adapt your tactics from round to round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=37 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/a4f2cf7d509b028b3415dff15d3c4b99.avif?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, you\u2019ll unlock a set of runes that let you fine-tune your experience \u2013 crank up the chaos or keep it under control, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/7ce6059f0659d5bc764a7de8347043aa.poster.avif?t=1760349741\" width=608 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/7ce6059f0659d5bc764a7de8347043aa.webm?t=1760349741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/7ce6059f0659d5bc764a7de8347043aa.mp4?t=1760349741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=37 /></span>Blast Head is a game where chaos turns into an art of destruction, and every choice you make \u2013 from weapons to runes \u2013 shapes a strange, one-of-a-kind story.<br><br>Test your skills, <strong>add Blast Head to your Steam Wishlist</strong>, and get ready for a ballet of total absurdity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=37 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084070?t=1760349741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084070?t=1760349741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/27b1acf5164b198facb81b0a3e863cb7dd16ae55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760349741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/27b1acf5164b198facb81b0a3e863cb7dd16ae55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760349741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084070/extras/c8c8dd036145c9abc712821901397c36.avif?t=1760349741\" width=609 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the <strong>demo version of Blast Head</strong>, giving you a taste of pure chaos. Thrown into a hostile arena as a failed experiment, your only mission is simple: survive and spread destruction.<br><br><strong>Blast Head</strong> is a <strong>bullet heaven</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> where every run feels fresh. In the